{"id":"otkuda","lemma":"откуда","pos":"adv","rank":203,"glosses":["whence, from where","from which","whence"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f4/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BA%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BA%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Откуда это?","en":"Where's it from?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/928188","words":[null,{"g":"this / it is"}]},{"text":"Откуда вы?","en":"Where do you come from?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/32731","words":[null,{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"}]},{"text":"Откуда они пришли?","en":"Where did they come from?","words":[null,{"g":"they"},{"g":"to come , to arrive","l":"прийти"}]},{"text":"Я знаю, откуда он.","en":"I know where he comes from.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},null,{"g":"he / it"}]},{"text":"Скажи мне, откуда ты.","en":"Tell me where you come from.","words":[{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"you"}]}]}